    "long_instructions": "AI is rapidly transforming nearly every industry by increasing productivity and reshaping how work gets done, especially in writing, research, data analysis, and other computer-based tasks.\r\n\r\nWatch the video below to learn more about the impact AI is having on various industries.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<details style=\"background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;\">\r\n    <summary style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;\">📝 Key Points from the Video</summary>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; padding-bottom:20px;\">\r\n    <p>\r\n\r\nAI is impacting the following fields...\r\n* Education: AI can function as an equalizer, potentially reducing disparities in learning opportunities and resources.\r\n* Healthcare: In the medical field, AI is being leveraged to develop new drugs and improve diagnostics, enhancing patient care.\r\n* Science and Technology: AI assists in advancing scientific research and technology development, speeding up innovations.\r\n\r\nWhile AI offers considerable benefits, it is crucial to consider the associated risks and consequences of its deployment, ensuring responsible and ethical use.\r\n\r\n</p></div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"
